* Word frequency: reads text from stdin (or the data after END)
        WORD = SPAN('abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ')
        SEP = BREAK('abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ')
        COUNT = TABLE()
READ    LINE = INPUT                         :F(DONE)
        LINE = REPLACE(LINE,'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ','abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz')
NEXT    LINE SEP =
        LINE WORD . W =                      :F(READ)
        COUNT<W> = COUNT<W> + 1              :(NEXT)
DONE    T = SORT(COUNT)
        I = 1
PRINT   OUTPUT = RPAD(T<I,1>,12) LPAD(T<I,2>,3)   :F(END)
        I = I + 1                            :(PRINT)
END
the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog
The dog barks; the fox runs away.
